OL,3,GLondon & South East                    
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells and cloudy periods on Thursday. 
OL,7,FA band of rain slowly moves eastwards  
OL,8,Fon Friday. Outbreaks of heavy rain on  
OL,9,FSaturday. Temperatures generally below 
OL,10,Faverage, recovering by the weekend.    
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
